                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00001         ********************************************************************
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00002         * RBF - Disk file manager
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00003         *
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00004         * nitros9/level1/modules/rbf.asm
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00005         *
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00006         * 2024-01-02 by strick:
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00007         * This version of level1/modules/rbf.asm is having comments and
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00008         * symbols backported from level2/modules/rbf.asm to minimize the
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00009         * diffs between the two.
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00010         *
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00011         * So far, we've been careful that level1 rbf assembles to exactly
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00012         * the same binary as before this diff.  However I am staging
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00013         * some shorter or quicker instructions for the H6309 that
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00014         * have been backported from Level2 into this version, but they
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00015         * are marked UNTESTED_H6309 instead of H6309, so they will not
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00016         * be actually used except when we really want to test them.
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00017         *
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00018         * As you edit either level1 or level2 rbf.asm, please minimize
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00019         * diffs between the two, in case we decide to do the work to
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00020         * unite them.  If possible, edit them in parallel with something
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00021         * like vimdiff.
                      (1/modules/rbf.asm):00022         *
